{"id":"vol9-07","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-07/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":330.77,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.2,"text":"Now turn to section 4 on page 7.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.34],["turn",0.34,0.64],["to",0.64,0.84],["section",0.84,1.08],["4",1.08,1.68],["on",1.68,2.44],["page",2.44,2.74],["7.",2.74,3.2]]},{"start":6.52,"end":9.88,"text":"You will hear part of a lecture in a business class.","words":[["You",6.52,6.8],["will",6.8,6.96],["hear",6.96,7.18],["part",7.18,7.48],["of",7.48,7.66],["a",7.66,7.82],["lecture",7.82,8.22],["in",8.22,8.88],["a",8.88,9.0],["business",9.0,9.3],["class.",9.3,9.88]]},{"start":11.06,"end":17.2,"text":"The professor is discussing a case study of a company in North America called Chokazine.","words":[["The",11.06,11.24],["professor",11.24,11.74],["is",11.74,12.22],["discussing",12.22,12.68],["a",12.68,12.94],["case",12.94,13.22],["study",13.22,13.68],["of",13.68,13.86],["a",13.86,13.98],["company",13.98,14.32],["in",14.32,14.6],["North",14.6,14.8],["America",14.8,15.32],["called",15.32,16.08],["Chokazine.",16.08,17.2]]},{"start":17.94,"end":23.66,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on page 7.","words":[["First,",17.94,18.44],["you",18.86,19.02],["have",19.02,19.2],["some",19.2,19.36],["time",19.36,19.72],["to",19.72,19.92],["look",19.92,20.04],["at",20.04,20.2],["questions",20.2,20.5],["31",20.5,21.4],["to",21.4,21.7],["40",21.7,22.12],["on",22.12,22.9],["page",22.9,23.18],["7.",23.18,23.66]]},{"start":73.9,"end":77.96,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",73.9,74.2],["listen",74.2,74.48],["carefully",74.48,74.92],["and",74.92,75.62],["answer",75.62,75.96],["questions",75.96,76.36],["31",76.36,77.28],["to",77.28,77.58],["40.",77.58,77.96]]},{"start":81.38,"end":85.86,"text":"We've been talking about small businesses and some of the challenges they face.","words":[["We've",81.38,81.98],["been",81.98,82.12],["talking",82.12,82.44],["about",82.44,82.76],["small",82.76,83.18],["businesses",83.18,83.64],["and",83.64,84.32],["some",84.32,84.56],["of",84.56,84.7],["the",84.7,84.8],["challenges",84.8,85.26],["they",85.26,85.54],["face.",85.54,85.86]]},{"start":86.78,"end":92.26,"text":"Today, I want to look at a case study based on a company called Chocazine that illustrates","words":[["Today,",86.78,87.16],["I",87.7,87.96],["want",87.96,88.18],["to",88.18,88.3],["look",88.3,88.46],["at",88.46,88.58],["a",88.58,88.68],["case",88.68,88.94],["study",88.94,89.26],["based",89.26,89.56],["on",89.56,89.82],["a",89.82,89.94],["company",89.94,90.24],["called",90.24,90.62],["Chocazine",90.62,91.4],["that",91.4,91.82],["illustrates",91.82,92.26]]},{"start":92.26,"end":95.32,"text":"the need to evaluate opportunities very carefully.","words":[["the",92.26,92.66],["need",92.66,92.9],["to",92.9,93.1],["evaluate",93.1,93.52],["opportunities",93.52,94.34],["very",94.34,94.86],["carefully.",94.86,95.32]]},{"start":96.46,"end":102.12,"text":"A man called Eric Smith and two of his colleagues were struck by the mass customization movement","words":[["A",96.46,96.64],["man",96.64,96.92],["called",96.92,97.26],["Eric",97.26,97.54],["Smith",97.54,97.82],["and",97.82,98.5],["two",98.5,98.72],["of",98.72,98.82],["his",98.82,98.94],["colleagues",98.94,99.38],["were",99.38,100.0],["struck",100.0,100.3],["by",100.3,100.54],["the",100.54,100.68],["mass",100.68,100.92],["customization",100.92,101.4],["movement",101.4,102.12]]},{"start":102.12,"end":105.48,"text":"that was spreading through a large number of industries in the US.","words":[["that",102.12,102.64],["was",102.64,102.78],["spreading",102.78,103.16],["through",103.16,103.38],["a",103.38,103.56],["large",103.56,103.84],["number",103.84,104.14],["of",104.14,104.32],["industries",104.32,104.78],["in",104.78,105.08],["the",105.08,105.18],["US.",105.18,105.48]]},{"start":105.48,"end":112.6,"text":"This involved mass producing products and at the same time, individually customizing them for their customers.","words":[["This",105.48,106.68],["involved",106.68,107.2],["mass",107.2,107.58],["producing",107.58,107.94],["products",107.94,108.48],["and",108.48,109.04],["at",109.04,109.14],["the",109.14,109.24],["same",109.24,109.46],["time,",109.46,109.82],["individually",110.28,110.72],["customizing",110.72,111.66],["them",111.66,111.84],["for",111.84,112.02],["their",112.02,112.16],["customers.",112.16,112.6]]},{"start":113.66,"end":116.14,"text":"Why not apply the same concept to chocolate?","words":[["Why",113.66,114.12],["not",114.12,114.32],["apply",114.32,114.62],["the",114.62,114.82],["same",114.82,115.12],["concept",115.12,115.58],["to",115.58,115.8],["chocolate?",115.8,116.14]]},{"start":117.08,"end":120.98,"text":"Customers could choose the ingredients they'd like to have put into their chocolate bars.","words":[["Customers",117.08,117.7],["could",117.7,117.84],["choose",117.84,118.12],["the",118.12,118.28],["ingredients",118.28,118.8],["they'd",118.8,119.2],["like",119.2,119.34],["to",119.34,119.5],["have",119.5,119.7],["put",119.7,119.92],["into",119.92,120.12],["their",120.12,120.3],["chocolate",120.3,120.64],["bars.",120.64,120.98]]},{"start":121.84,"end":127.34,"text":"So Smith and his colleagues decided to launch a customized chocolate operation called Chocozine.","words":[["So",121.84,122.08],["Smith",122.08,122.32],["and",122.32,122.56],["his",122.56,122.66],["colleagues",122.66,123.04],["decided",123.04,123.58],["to",123.58,123.82],["launch",123.82,124.08],["a",124.08,124.22],["customized",124.22,124.66],["chocolate",124.66,125.28],["operation",125.28,125.9],["called",125.9,126.38],["Chocozine.",126.38,127.34]]},{"start":128.12,"end":134.26,"text":"Then, when Chocosine was only about nine months old, Smith received an email from a large","words":[["Then,",128.12,128.8],["when",129.24,129.5],["Chocosine",129.5,130.04],["was",130.04,130.2],["only",130.2,130.46],["about",130.46,130.76],["nine",130.76,131.14],["months",131.14,131.34],["old,",131.34,131.76],["Smith",132.28,132.48],["received",132.48,132.96],["an",132.96,133.12],["email",133.12,133.5],["from",133.5,133.78],["a",133.78,133.96],["large",133.96,134.26]]},{"start":134.26,"end":135.8,"text":"European luxury retailer.","words":[["European",134.26,134.76],["luxury",134.76,135.18],["retailer.",135.18,135.8]]},{"start":136.66,"end":141.98,"text":"This retailer was inquiring about ordering 15,000 bars of chocolate for their customers.","words":[["This",136.66,137.08],["retailer",137.08,137.62],["was",137.62,137.9],["inquiring",137.9,138.52],["about",138.52,138.78],["ordering",138.78,139.28],["15",139.28,139.78],[",000",139.78,140.3],["bars",140.3,140.6],["of",140.6,140.82],["chocolate",140.82,141.18],["for",141.18,141.44],["their",141.44,141.56],["customers.",141.56,141.98]]},{"start":142.94,"end":148.48,"text":"They wanted to give these as a gift in their high-end stores in New York City, Miami and","words":[["They",142.94,143.2],["wanted",143.2,143.5],["to",143.5,143.72],["give",143.72,143.84],["these",143.84,144.08],["as",144.08,144.32],["a",144.32,144.4],["gift",144.4,144.7],["in",144.7,145.06],["their",145.06,145.18],["high",145.18,145.52],["-end",145.52,145.68],["stores",145.68,146.04],["in",146.04,146.64],["New",146.64,146.84],["York",146.84,147.04],["City,",147.04,147.34],["Miami",147.78,148.14],["and",148.14,148.48]]},{"start":148.48,"end":151.02,"text":"Los Angeles during the holiday shopping season.","words":[["Los",148.48,148.62],["Angeles",148.62,149.08],["during",149.08,149.72],["the",149.72,149.9],["holiday",149.9,150.2],["shopping",150.2,150.58],["season.",150.58,151.02]]},{"start":151.72,"end":157.58,"text":"The offer certainly sounded enticing because Chocozine was selling fewer than 150 chocolate","words":[["The",151.72,152.32],["offer",152.32,152.64],["certainly",152.64,153.12],["sounded",153.12,153.5],["enticing",153.5,154.08],["because",154.08,154.76],["Chocozine",154.76,155.38],["was",155.38,155.56],["selling",155.56,155.86],["fewer",155.86,156.3],["than",156.3,156.48],["150",156.48,157.12],["chocolate",157.12,157.58]]},{"start":157.58,"end":158.24,"text":"bars a day.","words":[["bars",157.58,157.84],["a",157.84,158.0],["day.",158.0,158.24]]},{"start":159.12,"end":164.38,"text":"Smith and his co-founders knew it could also be very good publicity, so they needed to","words":[["Smith",159.12,159.64],["and",159.64,159.92],["his",159.92,160.04],["co",160.04,160.24],["-founders",160.24,160.7],["knew",160.7,161.0],["it",161.0,161.18],["could",161.18,161.28],["also",161.28,161.62],["be",161.62,161.8],["very",161.8,162.16],["good",162.16,162.38],["publicity,",162.38,162.84],["so",163.42,163.84],["they",163.84,163.98],["needed",163.98,164.22],["to",164.22,164.38]]},{"start":164.38,"end":165.3,"text":"consider it carefully.","words":[["consider",164.38,164.7],["it",164.7,164.92],["carefully.",164.92,165.3]]},{"start":166.68,"end":168.36,"text":"They had many things to consider.","words":[["They",166.68,167.14],["had",167.14,167.34],["many",167.34,167.56],["things",167.56,167.84],["to",167.84,168.02],["consider.",168.02,168.36]]},{"start":169.26,"end":174.5,"text":"Obviously, it was a tempting offer, but at the same time, the risk was great.","words":[["Obviously,",169.26,169.86],["it",170.38,170.56],["was",170.56,170.68],["a",170.68,170.86],["tempting",170.86,171.08],["offer,",171.08,171.44],["but",171.8,172.28],["at",172.28,172.42],["the",172.42,172.5],["same",172.5,172.74],["time,",172.74,173.18],["the",173.5,173.62],["risk",173.62,173.94],["was",173.94,174.18],["great.",174.18,174.5]]},{"start":175.2,"end":178.3,"text":"They didn't know whether they could get the order completed in time.","words":[["They",175.2,175.5],["didn't",175.5,175.78],["know",175.78,176.1],["whether",176.1,176.4],["they",176.4,176.6],["could",176.6,176.76],["get",176.76,176.88],["the",176.88,177.04],["order",177.04,177.3],["completed",177.3,177.74],["in",177.74,177.96],["time.",177.96,178.3]]},{"start":178.94,"end":184.54,"text":"Also, if they accepted it, and then it turned out they couldn't do it, what about the financial","words":[["Also,",178.94,179.46],["if",179.92,180.16],["they",180.16,180.3],["accepted",180.3,180.72],["it,",180.72,180.98],["and",181.28,181.44],["then",181.44,181.56],["it",181.56,181.72],["turned",181.72,181.9],["out",181.9,182.12],["they",182.12,182.3],["couldn't",182.3,182.68],["do",182.68,182.88],["it,",182.88,183.12],["what",183.58,183.76],["about",183.76,183.94],["the",183.94,184.1],["financial",184.1,184.54]]},{"start":184.54,"end":188.3,"text":"fallout, as well as the possible damage to the company's reputation?","words":[["fallout,",184.54,185.18],["as",185.5,185.66],["well",185.66,185.9],["as",185.9,186.08],["the",186.08,186.18],["possible",186.18,186.54],["damage",186.54,187.02],["to",187.02,187.2],["the",187.2,187.32],["company's",187.32,187.76],["reputation?",187.76,188.3]]},{"start":189.16,"end":194.04,"text":"As well as this, another thing they had to think about was how they were actually going","words":[["As",189.16,189.6],["well",189.6,189.8],["as",189.8,190.0],["this,",190.0,190.22],["another",190.72,191.02],["thing",191.02,191.38],["they",191.38,191.52],["had",191.52,191.68],["to",191.68,191.8],["think",191.8,191.98],["about",191.98,192.3],["was",192.3,192.78],["how",192.78,193.0],["they",193.0,193.18],["were",193.18,193.32],["actually",193.32,193.78],["going",193.78,194.04]]},{"start":194.04,"end":198.54,"text":"to produce all these chocolate bars, as the number of machines they had was limited.","words":[["to",194.04,194.22],["produce",194.22,194.52],["all",194.52,194.88],["these",194.88,195.1],["chocolate",195.1,195.46],["bars,",195.46,195.8],["as",196.14,196.52],["the",196.52,196.64],["number",196.64,196.9],["of",196.9,197.04],["machines",197.04,197.4],["they",197.4,197.68],["had",197.68,197.96],["was",197.96,198.14],["limited.",198.14,198.54]]},{"start":199.24,"end":203.02,"text":"They only had three of them, and that clearly wasn't going to be enough.","words":[["They",199.24,199.54],["only",199.54,199.78],["had",199.78,200.08],["three",200.08,200.36],["of",200.36,200.54],["them,",200.54,200.74],["and",201.04,201.24],["that",201.24,201.4],["clearly",201.4,201.78],["wasn't",201.78,202.28],["going",202.28,202.46],["to",202.46,202.62],["be",202.62,202.74],["enough.",202.74,203.02]]},{"start":203.02,"end":213.16,"text":"So they decided to think creatively and try to find a subcontractor to produce the bars.","words":[["So",203.02,204.0],["they",208.48,208.66],["decided",208.66,209.12],["to",209.12,209.3],["think",209.3,209.48],["creatively",209.48,209.98],["and",209.98,210.5],["try",210.5,210.78],["to",210.78,210.94],["find",210.94,211.16],["a",211.16,211.32],["subcontractor",211.32,212.16],["to",212.16,212.34],["produce",212.34,212.64],["the",212.64,212.84],["bars.",212.84,213.16]]},{"start":214.18,"end":217.08,"text":"They weren't ready to pass up such a rare opportunity.","words":[["They",214.18,214.78],["weren't",214.78,215.06],["ready",215.06,215.32],["to",215.32,215.44],["pass",215.44,215.74],["up",215.74,215.92],["such",215.92,216.1],["a",216.1,216.22],["rare",216.22,216.46],["opportunity.",216.46,217.08]]},{"start":217.9,"end":221.34,"text":"Smith spent two days searching for a suitable subcontractor,","words":[["Smith",217.9,218.38],["spent",218.38,218.76],["two",218.76,219.08],["days",219.08,219.28],["searching",219.28,219.68],["for",219.68,219.94],["a",219.94,220.1],["suitable",220.1,220.32],["subcontractor,",220.32,221.34]]},{"start":221.74,"end":228.12,"text":"but he couldn't find anyone who had experience of making bars with the type of melted toppings that Chagosin used.","words":[["but",221.74,221.96],["he",221.96,222.1],["couldn't",222.1,222.44],["find",222.44,222.64],["anyone",222.64,223.12],["who",223.12,223.36],["had",223.36,223.5],["experience",223.5,224.06],["of",224.06,224.34],["making",224.34,224.6],["bars",224.6,225.06],["with",225.06,225.48],["the",225.48,225.6],["type",225.6,225.84],["of",225.84,225.96],["melted",225.96,226.26],["toppings",226.26,226.7],["that",226.7,227.02],["Chagosin",227.02,227.54],["used.",227.54,228.12]]},{"start":229.12,"end":231.22,"text":"Then something rather unexpected happened.","words":[["Then",229.12,229.48],["something",229.48,229.84],["rather",229.84,230.2],["unexpected",230.2,230.64],["happened.",230.64,231.22]]},{"start":232.02,"end":236.52,"text":"A professor at Harvard Business School was teaching a class about product customization.","words":[["A",232.02,232.14],["professor",232.14,232.52],["at",232.52,232.78],["Harvard",232.78,233.04],["Business",233.04,233.36],["School",233.36,233.78],["was",233.78,234.26],["teaching",234.26,234.54],["a",234.54,234.74],["class",234.74,235.04],["about",235.04,235.28],["product",235.28,235.72],["customization.",235.72,236.52]]},{"start":237.04,"end":240.38,"text":"So she wrote to Smith and asked if he would speak to the students.","words":[["So",237.04,237.52],["she",237.52,237.78],["wrote",237.78,238.0],["to",238.0,238.22],["Smith",238.22,238.36],["and",238.36,238.7],["asked",238.7,239.08],["if",239.08,239.28],["he",239.28,239.4],["would",239.4,239.52],["speak",239.52,239.76],["to",239.76,239.94],["the",239.94,240.06],["students.",240.06,240.38]]},{"start":241.2,"end":249.54,"text":"So when late October, Smith had an opportunity to talk about the deal to about 90 MBA students and to ask them for their advice.","words":[["So",241.2,241.68],["when",241.68,241.82],["late",241.82,242.04],["October,",242.04,242.4],["Smith",242.94,243.18],["had",243.18,243.48],["an",243.48,243.6],["opportunity",243.6,244.1],["to",244.1,244.5],["talk",244.5,244.8],["about",244.8,245.04],["the",245.04,245.2],["deal",245.2,245.52],["to",245.52,246.08],["about",246.08,246.32],["90",246.32,246.8],["MBA",246.8,247.22],["students",247.22,247.76],["and",247.76,248.3],["to",248.3,248.44],["ask",248.44,248.68],["them",248.68,248.88],["for",248.88,249.0],["their",249.0,249.14],["advice.",249.14,249.54]]},{"start":250.38,"end":254.42,"text":"Many of the students thought that doing the deal with a luxury retailer would be a mistake.","words":[["Many",250.38,250.76],["of",250.76,250.94],["the",250.94,251.06],["students",251.06,251.26],["thought",251.26,251.68],["that",251.68,251.88],["doing",251.88,252.12],["the",252.12,252.32],["deal",252.32,252.56],["with",252.56,252.7],["a",252.7,252.8],["luxury",252.8,253.08],["retailer",253.08,253.6],["would",253.6,253.84],["be",253.84,254.02],["a",254.02,254.1],["mistake.",254.1,254.42]]},{"start":255.42,"end":259.08,"text":"However, after the class, Smith spoke with one of the students.","words":[["However,",255.42,255.9],["after",256.36,256.68],["the",256.68,256.82],["class,",256.82,257.16],["Smith",257.62,257.84],["spoke",257.84,258.18],["with",258.18,258.38],["one",258.38,258.56],["of",258.56,258.64],["the",258.64,258.74],["students.",258.74,259.08]]},{"start":259.84,"end":268.34,"text":"This student had worked as a buyer at a major chocolate retailer, and he said he had a contact in the business who might be interested in doing the job.","words":[["This",259.84,260.36],["student",260.36,260.8],["had",260.8,261.06],["worked",261.06,261.32],["as",261.32,261.5],["a",261.5,261.64],["buyer",261.64,261.86],["at",261.86,262.14],["a",262.14,262.22],["major",262.22,262.6],["chocolate",262.6,263.02],["retailer,",263.02,263.54],["and",263.98,264.16],["he",264.16,264.42],["said",264.42,264.7],["he",264.7,264.9],["had",264.9,265.04],["a",265.04,265.12],["contact",265.12,265.52],["in",265.52,265.82],["the",265.82,265.9],["business",265.9,266.22],["who",266.22,266.66],["might",266.66,266.9],["be",266.9,267.08],["interested",267.08,267.44],["in",267.44,267.68],["doing",267.68,267.86],["the",267.86,268.04],["job.",268.04,268.34]]},{"start":269.66,"end":278.3,"text":"Smith called the new subcontractor the next day. He said he was interested in doing the order, but he found there were difficult technical issues to be worked o